  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 日本語版「チリヤシ」",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%81%E3%83%AA%E3%83%A4%E3%82%B7",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 109874172,
      "text": "チリヤシ、チリーヤシ、ジュベアヤシ は、ヤシ科に属する植物の一種である。チリヤシ属（ちりやしぞく）あるいはジュベアヤシ属 の唯一の種。南アメリカ南西部の南緯32-35度（チリ中央部）の固有種で、コキンボ州南部、バルパライソ州、首都州、オイギンス州、マウレ州北部に自生する。自然分布域において、若木は成木の近くの日当たりの良く植生のある場所を好む。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 英語版「Jubaea」",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jubaea",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 1369932434,
      "text": "Jubaea is a genus of palms with one species, Jubaea chilensis, commonly known in English as the Chilean wine palm or Chile cocopalm, and palma chilena in Spanish. It is native to southwestern South America and is endemic to a small area of central Chile between 32°S and 35°S in southern Coquimbo, Valparaíso, Santiago, O'Higgins, and northern Maule regions."
    }
  },
